# Auto-poweroff schedule (input for run_onchange_9_1_auto_poweroff_timer.sh).
#
# One wall-clock time per line, 24h "HH:MM". Each becomes one systemd
# OnCalendar trigger (`*-*-* HH:MM:00`), evaluated in the system's local
# timezone. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Add as many as you want, e.g.:
#   03:00
#   22:30

03:00
